          "text": "Skip to content\n\nHomeFull MenuReservationsPrivate Event ReservationsVIP ReservationsUpcoming EventsAboutThe Gulf Babe PodcastJoin the Wine Club!Gulf Babe BlogShop Merch\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nTikTok\n\nSpotify\n\nDiscover Your new favorite pink bar on the gulf coasT!\n\nGulf Babe is more than just wine – it’s a lifestyle. A place to feel confident, comfortable, and completely yourself. Come sip, unwind, and remember that being a babe is a state of mind, no matter the day.\n\nFollow us\n\n@gulfbabe_wineboutique\n\nWeekly Events\n\nMahjong Monday\n\nEVERY MONDAY\n\nJoin us every Monday from 5PM–9PM for open Mahjong play at Gulf Babe Wine Boutique. Whether you’re a seasoned pro, newly obsessed, or just Mahjong-curious, this is your weekly excuse to gather, sip, and play.\n\n Open Play Every Monday\n\nSee More Events!\n\nYappy Hour\n\nTUES & THURS FROM 2-6 PM\n\nYour new favorite weekly happy hour at the pink bar. Join us for drink specials, good vibes, and the perfect excuse to unwind with your girls. Whether you’re kicking off the night or just stopping by, Yappy Hour is all about sipping, socializing, and making it a vibe.\n\ngulf babe\n\nSee More Events!\n\nLocation\n\n4593 Main St. Suite C-101 \n\nOrange Beach, AL 36561 \n\nHours\n\nMonday-Thursday 11am-9pm\n\nFriday-Saturday 11am-12am\n\nSunday 11am-8pm\n\nContact\n\n251.495.0573gulfbabewine@gmail.com\n\nDesigned by Rip Tide Marketing LLC\n\nView our Privacy Policy \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Loading Comments...\n \n \n \n \n \n \n Write a Comment...\n \n \n \n \n Email (Required)\n \n \n \n Name (Required)\n \n \n \n Website",
