          "text": "Skip to content\n\nHomeFull MenuReservationsPrivate Event ReservationsVIP ReservationsUpcoming EventsAboutThe Gulf Babe PodcastJoin the Wine Club!Gulf Babe BlogShop Merch\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nTikTok\n\nSpotify\n\nTHE GULF BABE WINE CLUB IS LIVE\n\nThe Gulf Babe Wine Club is for the curious sipper who loves discovering something new. Each month, we curate a fresh theme and select a featured wine designed to take you outside your usual go-to and into something exciting. It’s all about exploring new regions, styles, and flavors, one bottle at a time, no pressure, just good wine and great vibes.\n\nPick your CLub! \n\nYour lifestyle, your wine style!\n\nThe Signature Babe\n\n$80/ month\n\n✓ Two carefully curated bottles/month\n\n✓ 10% off wine products and merch\n\n✓ 10% off wine tasting events\n\n✓ Two complimentary tasting flights per year\n\n✓ Gulf Babe Wine Club shirt and insulated wine bag upon joining\n\nSign Up\n\nThe Luxe babe\n\n$150 / month\n\n✓ Four expertly curated bottles/month \n\n✓ 10% off wine products\n\n✓ 10% off wine tasting events\n\n✓ Four complimentary flights per year\n\n✓ Gulf Babe Wine Club shirt and insulated wine bag upon joining.\n\nwine\n\nSign Up\n\nGrand reserve babe\n\n$460 / month\n\n✓ Three handpicked, exclusive reserve bottles/month \n\n✓ 15% off wine products and merch\n\n✓ 15% off wine tasting events \n\n✓ Four complimentary tasting flights per year\n\n✓ Gulf Babe Wine Club shirt and insulated wine bag upon joining\n\nSign Up\n\nSnowbird Babe\n\n$280 for 3 months\n\n✓ Three handpicked, exclusive reserve bottles/month \n\n✓ 15% off wine products and merch\n\n✓ 15% off wine tasting events \n\n✓ Four complimentary tasting flights per year\n\n✓ Gulf Babe Wine Club shirt and insulated wine bag upon joining\n\nSign Up\n\nReviews\n\nPaul & Nancy \n\n“From day one the Gulf Babe Wine Boutique wine club has instilled in us a thirst for wines from around the world. We look forward to a new wine each month from a different region. A 10% discount on wine tastings is an additional benefit”\n\nMegan\n\n“I’ve been a proud Grand Reserve Babe member of the Gulf Babe Wine Club for some time now, and I haven’t regretted a single moment of it.\n\nWhat sets Gulf Babe apart is their extraordinary attention to detail in curating exclusive wines each month. They collaborate closely with top-tier wine representatives to deliver exceptional value – truly the best wines for your money. Every bottle is thoughtfully selected, not just for its outstanding quality and flavor, but also for its captivating story. From inspiring tales like a woman’s remarkable journey from South Africa to founding her own winery, to prestigious champagnes bearing a royal decree tied to the British monarchy since Queen Victoria’s era, each delivery feels special, meaningful, and utterly delicious.”\n\nPREVIOUS WINE CLUB THEMES!\n\nLocation\n\n4593 Main St. Suite C-101 \n\nOrange Beach, AL 36561 \n\nHours\n\nMonday-Thursday 11am-9pm\n\nFriday-Saturday 11am-12am\n\nSunday 11am-8pm\n\nContact\n\n251.495.0573gulfbabewine@gmail.com\n\nDesigned by Rip Tide Marketing LLC\n\nView our Privacy Policy",
